DOMAIN-SUFFIX,musical.ly,TikTok短视频

# TikTok视频CDN精确匹配
DOMAIN,api16-normal-c-useast1a.tiktokv.com,TikTok短视频
DOMAIN,api16-normal-useast1a.tiktokv.com,TikTok短视频
{{/TikTok优化}}

